What the license covers

  Individual Unicode characters belong to no one. What this dataset
  contributes, and what CC BY 4.0 applies to, is the selection: which
  symbols and multi-character combos a copy-and-paste symbol site offers,
  how they are grouped into categories, the order within each category,
  and the category names in six languages. The selection is FontVibe's.

